scootbar for Debian/Ubuntu
-------------------------

The bar ships a systemd user unit (scootbar.service). To run it as a
user service: copy /usr/share/doc/scootbar/bar.toml.example to
~/.config/scoot/bar.toml, then systemctl --user enable --now scootbar.
A config change does not restart the unit; run `scootbar msg reload`
instead.
